    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8bc5d7aa",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "Skeptical admiration mapped onto Morgan Freeman",
      "description": "The text 'i don't understand your specific kind of stupid. but i do admire your total commitment to it.' is mapped onto Morgan Freeman's visual persona. His skeptical, slightly amused expression and calm, wise demeanor are used to embody the tone of the text — conveying a sarcastic dismissal mixed with reluctant admiration. The visual material (Morgan Freeman) is analogically mapped to the textual concept of a person expressing this specific kind of skeptical admiration.",
