      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Sarcastic dismissal of irrational behavior",
      "description": "The text 'i don't understand your specific kind of stupid. but i do admire your total commitment to it.' is a form of sarcastic, dismissive, and mocking commentary. While it targets a specific behavior or belief (irrationality or stubbornness), it does not target any individual or group based on protected characteristics such as race, gender, religion, or sexual orientation. The humor is derived from the contrast between the dignified persona of Morgan Freeman and the crude text, and it is intended as a lighthearted, non-harmful form of internet humor. The meme does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic content. The toxicity here is minimal and stems from the crude nature of the text, but it is not directed at any protected group or individual in a harmful way.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5b12556e"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
